This contribution permission does not authorize a commercial Forked Build. You confirm that you have the right to submit the contribution under these terms.

6. Names and Marks

This license does not grant permission to use Dopad names, logos, or other trademarks to suggest endorsement or official status. You may identify compatibility or describe a Forked Build as a fork, provided the description is accurate and does not imply endorsement.

